        <h1>About Adrian Parker</h1>

        <p>I'm Adrian Parker, and I live in Wellington, New Zealand.</p>

        <p>When I first started this site, I thought I might write <a href="/posts/">posts</a> about product management, finance, software, investment and travel, adorned with whimsical anecdotes about life. Instead, I review the <a href="/gigs/">gigs</a> I go to, and keep a <a href="/Gig-History/">history of every one</a>. And I build small <a href="/apps/">browser-based apps</a> that run entirely on your own computer.</p>

        <p>Away from the keyboard I'm a keen scuba diver (see <a href="/posts/Tangalooma-Wrecks/">Tangalooma Wrecks</a> and <a href="/posts/Beqa-Lagoon-Shark-Dive-1/">sharks at Beqa Lagoon</a>), and passionate about football: I've been both a Fulham FC and Wellington Phoenix season ticket holder, and follow them both closely. I'm also an <a href="/posts/Last-Ever-Last-Ever/">ex bootleg kingpin</a> and a reformed wine enthusiast with a <a href="/posts/Wine-Cork-Notice-Board-How-To/">notice board made of the evidence</a>.</p>

        <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
        <p>The best way to reach me is a message on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/adrianparker">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
        <p>Spotted something wrong or broken on this site? <a href="https://github.com/adrianparker/adrianparker.github.io/issues">Open an issue on GitHub</a>.</p>

